Bug_Details:
This field is guaranteed not to be set given it's within a switch over a one_of. When switching over a proto one_of, getters that don’t match the current case
are guaranteed to be return a default instance: switch (foo.getBlahCase()) {
  case FOO:
    return foo.getFoo();
  case BAR:
    return foo.getFoo(); // should be foo.getBar()
} switch (foo.getBlahCase()) {
  case FOO:
    return foo.getFoo();
  case BAR:
    return foo.getFoo(); // should be foo.getBar()
}
